  "limits": [
    "Host register and memory responses exercise the actual owners but do not emulate or qualify Picasso hardware.",
    "No live AMD rendering, shader dispatch or Vulkan capability is advertised by software PM4 encoding.",
    "Native startup implements original golden state, measured topology, RLC/CSB, KIQ/MQD map and two exact GFX/compute register-IB rounds; no physical run in this milestone.",
    "Caller-pinned resource ownership survives uncertain publication, timeouts, failed retirement and stale generations until exact completion or proven GC quiescence.",
    "Compute scratch uses the GFX9 shader descriptor convention, which the later compiler/provider must match; shader compilation and full render context follow in /13 and /14.",
    "Bounded CPU scheduling and age priority are not hardware preemption of a running shader.",
    "GC stop proves only GFX/compute quiescence; SDMA and IRQ/arena release remain with their existing independent owner.",
    "Kernel/Contract/SDK are unchanged; no additional guest run was needed for passive mode.",
    "Only 0.80.39 performs the physical laptop validation."
